<title>USA: Archuletta &amp; Hinsdale Ctys, Colo., yields 5.60 pct.</title>
<headline>Archuletta &amp; Hinsdale Ctys, Colo., yields 5.60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc said it priced $12.020 million of Archuleta and Hinsdale Counties Joint School District No. 50 (Pagosa Springs) Colo., general obligation bonds with a top yield of 5.60 percent in 2020.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
<p>AMT: 12,020,000     DATE: 12/09/96</p>
<p>ISSUER: Archuleta&amp;Hinsdale Cos Jt Sd 50 (Pagosa Springs)    ST: CO</p>
<p>ISSUE: General obligation</p>
<p>TAX STAT: Exempt-ULT</p>
<p>M/SP/F: A1/NA/NA							BOOK ENTRY: N</p>
<p>ENHANCEMENTS: None</p>
<p>DTD: 12/01/96							     SURE BID: N</p>
<p>DUE: 12/15/00-10, 15, 20</p>
<p>1ST CPN: 06/15/97					   CALL: 12/15/06 @ 101</p>
<p>ORDERS: 200 EST</p>
<p>NOTES: (State Intercept Project)</p>
<p>Year		     Amount    Coupon     Yield</p>
<p>2000		    330,000     5.125     4.400</p>
<p>2001		    345,000     5.125     4.500</p>
<p>2002		    360,000     5.125     4.600</p>
<p>2003		    380,000     5.125     4.700</p>
<p>2004		    400,000     5.125     4.800</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------</p>
